哦，嘿。

365
00:14:53,960 --> 00:14:55,200
Can you, uh, can you hang on a second?
你能，呃，你能等一下嗎？

366
00:14:55,900 --> 00:14:57,760
It's the producers over at Mac and Cheese.
這是 Mac and Cheese 的製作人。

367
00:14:57,860 --> 00:14:59,520
If you'll excuse me for a minute.
請原諒我一下。

368
00:15:01,600 --> 00:15:03,320
Hey, funny you should call.
嘿，有趣的是你應該打電話。

369
00:15:03,400 --> 00:15:05,220
I was just looking over next week's script.
我只是在看下週的劇本。

370
00:15:07,440 --> 00:15:07,880
Canceled?
取消？

371
00:15:09,740 --> 00:15:11,080
Like they're taking it off the air?
就像他們要停止播出一樣？

372
00:15:11,440 --> 00:15:11,700
Oh.
哦。

373
00:15:13,420 --> 00:15:14,000
All right.
好的。

374
00:15:14,600 --> 00:15:15,560
I'll see you Monday.
週一見。

375
00:15:17,040 --> 00:15:18,680
We're not even shooting them anymore?
我們甚至不再拍攝他們了？

376
00:15:20,060 --> 00:15:20,820
All right.
好的。

377
00:15:20,820 --> 00:15:21,540
Bye.
再見。

378
00:15:23,580 --> 00:15:25,680
They canceled Mac and Cheese!
他們取消了通心粉和起司！

379
00:15:25,780 --> 00:15:26,600
Oh, Joey.
哦，喬伊。

380
00:15:26,700 --> 00:15:27,520
Sorry, Joey.
對不起，喬伊。

381
00:15:27,660 --> 00:15:28,760
Why would they do that?
他們為什麼要這麼做？

382
00:15:28,840 --> 00:15:30,160
It was a good show, right?
這是一場精彩的表演，對吧？

383
00:15:42,500 --> 00:15:43,620
You want to tell secrets?
你想說出秘密嗎？

384
00:15:43,900 --> 00:15:44,800
Okay, okay.
好吧，好吧。

385
00:15:44,940 --> 00:15:47,760
In college, Ross used to wear leg warmers.
在大學裡，羅斯曾經穿著暖腿套。

386
00:15:47,760 --> 00:15:47,880
What?
什麼？

387
00:15:49,260 --> 00:15:50,740
All right, all right.
好吧，好吧。

388
00:15:51,440 --> 00:15:54,580
Chandler entered a vanilla ice look-a-like contest and won.
錢德勒參加了一場類似香草冰的比賽並獲勝。

389
00:15:56,740 --> 00:15:58,860
Ross came in fourth and cried.
羅斯排名第四，哭了。

390
00:16:01,060 --> 00:16:01,580
Hey!
嘿！

391
00:16:02,460 --> 00:16:03,600
I welled up.
我湧了上來。

392
00:16:03,740 --> 00:16:04,640
Oh, my God!
我的天啊！

393
00:16:05,920 --> 00:16:07,060
Oh, is that funny?
哦，這很好笑嗎？

394
00:16:07,220 --> 00:16:08,400
Oh, you find that funny?
哦，你覺得這很有趣嗎？

395
00:16:08,900 --> 00:16:11,640
Well, maybe Chandler should know some of your secrets, too.
好吧，也許錢德勒也應該知道你的一些秘密。

396
00:16:12,440 --> 00:16:14,340
I already told him everything.
我已經告訴他一切了。

397
00:16:14,480 --> 00:16:15,160
You, shush!
你，噓！

398
00:16:16,900 --> 00:16:19,300
Once, Monica was sent to a room without dinner,
有一次，莫妮卡被送到一個房間，沒有吃晚飯，

399
00:16:19,480 --> 00:16:22,400
so she ate the macaroni off a jewelry box she'd made.
於是她吃了自己做的珠寶盒裡的通心粉。

400
00:16:25,160 --> 00:16:27,360
Ross used to stay home every Saturday night
羅斯過去每週六晚上都待在家裡

401
00:16:27,360 --> 00:16:28,820
to watch Golden Girls.
去看《黃金女郎》。

402
00:16:31,320 --> 00:16:33,820
Monica couldn't tell time until she was 13.
莫妮卡直到 13 歲才知道時間。

403
00:16:36,100 --> 00:16:37,860
It's hard for some people.
對某些人來說很難。

404
00:16:39,200 --> 00:16:40,820
Of course it is.
當然是。

405
00:16:43,420 --> 00:16:45,140
Chandler once had me wear my underwear to work.
錢德勒曾經讓我穿內衣去上班。

406
00:16:46,140 --> 00:16:46,420
Oh!
哦！

407
00:16:48,320 --> 00:16:50,340
I'm sorry, I couldn't think of any more for Ross.
抱歉，我無法再為羅斯想更多的事了。

408
00:16:51,100 --> 00:16:53,540
Oh, oh, in college, Chandler got drunk
哦，哦，在大學裡，錢德勒喝醉了

409
00:16:53,540 --> 00:16:55,600
and slept with the lady who cleaned our dorm.
和打掃我們宿舍的女士一起睡。

410
00:16:55,880 --> 00:16:55,980
Ah!
啊!

411
00:16:57,500 --> 00:16:58,540
That was you.
那是你。

412
00:16:58,780 --> 00:16:59,020
Ah!
啊!

413
00:17:01,900 --> 00:17:03,580
Whatever, dude, you kissed a guy.
無論如何，夥計，你吻了一個男人。

414
00:17:05,840 --> 00:17:07,440
I can't believe this.
我簡直不敢相信這一點。

415
00:17:08,380 --> 00:17:09,880
Mac and Cheese was a great show.
通心粉和起司是一場精彩的表演。

416
00:17:10,700 --> 00:17:13,280
How about that scene where Mac teaches Cheese how to yodel?
麥克教起司如何唱約德爾的那場戲怎麼樣？

417
00:17:13,280 --> 00:17:17,420
Oh, yeah, I actually liked that part.
哦，是的，我真的很喜歡那部分。

418
00:17:19,960 --> 00:17:21,580
How could this happen to me?
這怎麼會發生在我身上？

419
00:17:22,180 --> 00:17:24,260
Yesterday, I had two TV shows.
昨天，我看了兩部電視節目。

420
00:17:24,600 --> 00:17:26,320
Today, I got nothing.
今天，我什麼也沒得到。

421
00:17:27,060 --> 00:17:27,640
Well, wait a minute.
好吧，等一下。

422
00:17:27,700 --> 00:17:29,360
What happened to Days of Our Lives?
《我們的日子》發生了什麼事？

423
00:17:30,020 --> 00:17:32,560
Uh, well, they might be a little mad at me over there.
呃，好吧，他們可能對我有點生氣。

424
00:17:33,700 --> 00:17:34,540
What happened?
發生了什麼事？

425
00:17:34,900 --> 00:17:36,560
Well, maybe I got a little upset
好吧，也許我有點不高興

426
00:17:37,080 --> 00:17:39,440
and maybe I told them where they could go.
也許我告訴他們可以去哪裡。

427
00:17:41,040 --> 00:17:43,180
Joey, why would you do that?
喬伊，為什麼要這麼做？

428
00:17:43,180 --> 00:17:45,120
Because they wanted me to audition.
因為他們想讓我去試鏡。

429
00:17:45,660 --> 00:17:47,380
You? An actor?
你？演員？

430
00:17:47,860 --> 00:17:49,020
That's madness!
這太瘋狂了！

431
00:17:56,440 --> 00:17:57,940
Rachel Green's office.
雷切爾格林的辦公室。

432
00:18:01,000 --> 00:18:01,840
Tag.
標籤。

433
00:18:02,520 --> 00:18:03,700
Hi. Who was that?
你好。那是誰？

434
00:18:04,300 --> 00:18:04,700
Nobody.
沒有人。

435
00:18:05,380 --> 00:18:06,620
I was just practicing.
我只是在練習。

436
00:18:07,760 --> 00:18:08,140
Really?
真的嗎？

437
00:18:14,520 --> 00:18:14,880
Hi.
你好。

438
00:18:15,320 --> 00:18:16,740
Hi. Rachel Green's office.
你好。雷切爾格林的辦公室。

439
00:18:19,040 --> 00:18:20,040
You must be Hilda.
你一定是希爾達。

440
00:18:23,000 --> 00:18:25,920
Yeah, this is Tag. Tag, this is Phoebe. Phoebe, can I see you for a second?
是的，這是塔格。標記，這是菲比。菲比，我可以見見你嗎？

441
00:18:26,720 --> 00:18:27,080
Phoebe?
菲比？

442
00:18:28,360 --> 00:18:29,280
That's a great name.
這是一個很棒的名字。

443
00:18:29,640 --> 00:18:31,420
Oh, you like that? You should hear my phone number.
哦，你喜歡這樣嗎？你應該聽聽我的電話號碼。

444
00:18:32,000 --> 00:18:33,800
Okay, well, I'll be right back.
好的，好的，我馬上回來。

445
00:18:38,460 --> 00:18:40,580
So, you hired yourself a little treat, did ya?
那麼，你給自己僱了一點款待，是嗎？

446
00:18:42,380 --> 00:18:45,000
All right, I know. I know how it looks, Phoebs, but I'm telling you...
好吧，我知道了。我知道它看起來是什麼樣子，菲布斯，但我告訴你...

447
00:18:45,000 --> 00:18:47,520
No, but you know you cannot get involved with your assistant.
不可以，但你知道你不能與你的助理有任何瓜葛。

448
00:18:47,780 --> 00:18:49,340
Yes, I know that. I know that.
是的，我知道。我知道。

449
00:18:49,340 --> 00:18:52,780
And I know that hiring him was probably not the smartest thing that I've ever done,
我知道僱用他可能不是我做過的最明智的事情

450
00:18:52,840 --> 00:18:56,160
but I'm telling you, from this moment on, I swear this is strictly professional.
但我告訴你，從這一刻起，我發誓這絕對是專業的。

451
00:18:56,900 --> 00:18:57,260
Yes?
是的？

452
00:18:57,880 --> 00:18:58,580
Hey, Rachel.
嘿，雷切爾。

453
00:18:58,820 --> 00:18:59,180
Hi.
你好。

454
00:19:00,320 --> 00:19:03,440
Cute assistant. What's his story? Is he like...
可愛的助理。他的故事是什麼？他是不是像...

455
00:19:03,440 --> 00:19:04,480
Gay, yeah.
同性戀，是的。

456
00:19:10,040 --> 00:19:10,400
Hey.
嘿。

457
00:19:11,520 --> 00:19:11,960
Terry.
特里.

458
00:19:13,740 --> 00:19:17,680
Joey Tribbiani. Surprised your big head could fit through our small halls.
喬伊·崔比亞尼。很驚訝你的大腦袋能穿過我們的小廳。

459
00:19:19,440 --> 00:19:20,500
I gotta go, Joey.
我得走了，喬伊。

460
00:19:20,680 --> 00:19:24,040
Wait, Terry. Look, I'm really sorry about before.
等等，特里。聽著，我真的很抱歉之前的事。

461
00:19:24,200 --> 00:19:27,380
I was an idiot thinking I'm too big to audition for you.
我當時真是個白痴，以為自己太大了，無法為你試鏡。

462
00:19:27,780 --> 00:19:28,940
You gotta give me another chance.
你得再給我一次機會。

463
00:19:29,000 --> 00:19:29,760
I can't help you, Joey.
我幫不了你，喬伊。

464
00:19:29,760 --> 00:19:30,940
Wait, Terry, please!
等等，特里，拜託！

465
00:19:33,040 --> 00:19:37,920
Look, I just lost my other job, okay? You have no idea how much I need this.
聽著，我剛剛失去了另一份工作，好嗎？你不知道我有多需要這個。

466
00:19:37,920 --> 00:19:41,700
Please, help me out. For old time's sake.
請幫幫我。為了舊時光。

467
00:19:43,440 --> 00:19:46,120
This poor guy's been in a coma for five years.
這個可憐的傢伙已經昏迷了五年了。

468
00:19:46,540 --> 00:19:47,300
It's hopeless.
這是沒有希望的。

469
00:19:47,620 --> 00:19:50,420
It's not hopeless. Dr. Stryker Remory's a miracle worker.
這並非毫無希望。 Stryker Remory 博士是一位創造奇蹟的人。

470
00:19:50,900 --> 00:19:51,700
Look, here he comes.
看，他來了。

471
00:19:52,600 --> 00:19:53,200
Good morning.
早安。

472
00:20:00,060 --> 00:20:03,980
Drake, it's your brother, Stryker. Can you hear me?
德瑞克，這是你的兄弟，史賽克。你聽得到我嗎？

473
00:20:05,220 --> 00:20:06,260
And cut.
並切。

474
00:20:09,060 --> 00:20:10,540
I'm back, baby!
我回來了，寶貝！

475
00:20:22,980 --> 00:20:29,020
You know, in my defense, there was no glitter on the macaroni and very little glue.
你知道，在我看來，通心粉上沒有閃光，膠水也很少。

476
00:20:30,280 --> 00:20:33,300
And in my defense, the cleaning lady came on to me.
為了我的辯護，清潔女工向我走來。

477
00:20:35,060 --> 00:20:37,240
You have no trouble telling time now, right?
你現在看時間沒有困難了，對吧？

478
00:20:37,680 --> 00:20:38,080
No.
不。

479
00:20:38,540 --> 00:20:39,520
Quick, what time is it?
快點，現在幾點了？

480
00:20:39,680 --> 00:20:41,120
I don't know. Time to kiss a guy, maybe?
我不知道。也許是時候親吻一個男人了？

481
00:20:45,420 --> 00:20:47,180
What are you laughing at, pampers?
幫寶適你笑什麼？

482
00:20:50,620 --> 00:20:55,440
You know when I said that because we're getting married, we should share everything and not have any secrets?
你知道我說過，因為我們要結婚了，所以我們應該分享一切，沒有任何秘密？

483
00:20:56,160 --> 00:20:56,420
Yeah.
是的。

484
00:20:56,800 --> 00:20:59,000
Yeah, that was stupid. Let's not do that.
是的，那太愚蠢了。我們不要那樣做。

485
00:21:00,640 --> 00:21:01,040
Absolutely.
絕對地。

486
00:21:01,760 --> 00:21:05,020
I'm on board. Thank you, and thank you.
我在船上。謝謝你，也謝謝你。

487
00:21:06,280 --> 00:21:10,740
And we should keep all the stuff we told each other secret from everybody else.
我們應該對其他人保密我們告訴對方的所有事情。

488
00:21:10,820 --> 00:21:11,800
Yeah, definitely.
是的，絕對是。

489
00:21:14,080 --> 00:21:20,380
Okay. If you'll excuse me, I'm going to go hang out with some people who don't know the space mountain story.
好的。打擾一下，我要去和一些不知道太空山故事的人一起出去玩。

490
00:21:20,960 --> 00:21:22,580
Then I'd steer clear of Phoebe.
然後我就會避開菲比。

491
00:21:24,340 --> 00:21:24,720
Man.
男人。

492
00:21:26,280 --> 00:21:30,060
Yeah, not that you would, but I wouldn't hang out with all the guys in my office.
是的，你不會，但我不會和辦公室裡的所有人一起出去玩。

493
00:21:40,900 --> 00:21:41,360
Hi.
你好。

494
00:21:42,160 --> 00:21:42,620
Hi.
你好。

495
00:21:44,040 --> 00:21:44,900
Do you have a minute?
你有時間嗎？

496
00:21:45,400 --> 00:21:46,720
Oh, yeah, sure. What's up?
哦，是的，當然。這是怎麼回事？

497
00:21:47,280 --> 00:21:50,100
I got asked out twice today while I was at lunch.
今天吃午餐的時候有人邀我出去兩次。

498
00:21:51,160 --> 00:21:51,980
By guys.
由夥計們。

499
00:21:55,180 --> 00:21:55,640
Really?
真的嗎？

500
00:21:56,000 --> 00:21:56,340
Yeah.
是的。

501
00:21:56,840 --> 00:21:58,820
Did you tell someone that I was gay?
你有沒有告訴別人我是同性戀？

502
00:21:59,240 --> 00:22:01,720
Oh, did you not want people to know that?
哦，你不想讓人知道嗎？

503
00:22:03,640 --> 00:22:04,640
No, I'm not gay.
不，我不是同性戀。

504
00:22:04,640 --> 00:22:08,360
And I especially wouldn't want you to think I was gay.
我尤其不想讓你認為我是同性戀。

505
00:22:09,040 --> 00:22:09,800
Why's that?
這是為什麼呢？

506
00:22:12,240 --> 00:22:13,620
I don't think I should say.
我想我不應該說。

507
00:22:13,940 --> 00:22:15,380
Oh, you can say.
哦，你可以說。

508
00:22:17,340 --> 00:22:20,520
Come on, I don't want you to feel like you can't tell me things.
得了吧，我不想讓你覺得你不能告訴我事情。

509
00:22:24,220 --> 00:22:24,700
Okay.
好的。

510
00:22:25,120 --> 00:22:25,460
Okay.
好的。

511
00:22:26,360 --> 00:22:26,840
Well.
出色地。

512
00:22:27,140 --> 00:22:27,540
Yeah.
是的。

513
00:22:28,540 --> 00:22:30,580
I'd love to ask out your friend, Phoebe.
我很想約你的朋友菲比出去。

514
00:22:33,600 --> 00:22:35,320
Yeah, she's gay.
是的，她是同性戀。

